cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Akhmadeev
    given-names: Timur
title: "bio-lif-core: LIF neuron with exact integrator"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/timur-akhmadeev/bio-lif-core"
abstract: >
  A Leaky Integrate-and-Fire (LIF) neuron with physical units (mV, nA, MΩ, ms),
  exact analytical integrator, strong validation, and 98 unit tests. Core of
  the BioMorph research project on biomorphic systems based on the Drosophila
  melanogaster connectome.
keywords:
  - spiking neural networks
  - LIF neuron
  - neuromorphic computing
  - connectome
  - Drosophila melanogaster
